 "sweep_id": "cnn_lif_screen_1",
 "description": "First screen of the CNN + LIF hybrid (model family 3a, plan 4.4): the CNN's front end (three blocks at the base), its frames averaged over frequency (or flattened) and optionally over groups of steps, then 1 to 3 layers of LIF neurons (affect.models.lif, checked against a numpy reference) and a leaky-integrator readout. Training settings of the CNN + Transformer's base (cnn_final_1's). Neurons start from the literature review, section 10: leak 0.9, learned per layer; threshold 1; reset by subtraction; arctan surrogate, slope 2; no activity penalty. Stages: the base on 5 seeds (seed noise); shuffled training labels on 2 seeds (the leak test, UA near 0.25); each listed level alone from the base, 3 seeds; random configurations over every factor, 3 seeds; random_extra, more of the same draw as filler. Validation only.",
